  "title": "Tricomi — reference 1",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Tricomi — reference 1",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Relier les contrôles aux ports nommés, puis lancer Run. Les types et valeurs sont explicites; sélectionner la fiche n'exécute rien.\nEntrées : x (f64) = 0.01; a (f64) = 1; b (f64) = 1.\nRésultats attendus : value (f64) = 4.078511443456425826642748748349806682068040904478682042.\n\nEvaluates confluent hypergeometric U, a distinct solution from Kummer M; never 1/M, 1-M or regularized M.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: windows-x64; LLVM 22.1.7; exact declared scalar signature.\nExpected:\noutput-value (f64) = 4.078511443456425826642748748349806682068040904478682042\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["numeric-math", "typed-values", "independent-oracle", "example"],
    "documentation_uri": ""
  },
